            "review_title": "Review at Pho Thinh",
            "review_text": "Trevor Saldanha\nMumbai, India7621 contributions\n0\nSmall, Local Vietnamese Family Run Restaurant Specializing in the Vietnamese All Time Specialty - Pho Ga\nOct 2023 • Couples\nSmall, Local Vietnamese Family Run Restaurant Specializing in the Vietnamese All Time Specialty - Pho Ga, which is a Special Vietnamese Flat Rice Noodle Soup with Chicken and Greens. This is virtually the National Dish of Vietnam and is had for Breakfast, Brunch, Lunch or Dinner. Superbly made with Very Fresh Ingredients and Absolutely Yummy. Great place for First Timers to try out this Famous Vietnamese Dish which is a Must Have whenever you are in Vietnam.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 17, 2023",
